    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "***APPLY VIA EMAIL ONLY***\r\nDiscover the luxury of city centre living at 109 The Quay Waterford. An exclusive building consisting of 3 stunning apartments. This prime location offers unparalleled convenience. The building has been completed to an extremely high standard which would rival any in the current market. \r\n \r\nAdvertised apartment consists of living and dining area with 2 bedrooms to the front. The bathroom boasts a fully tiled, stylish and modern finish. \r\nThe kitchen is fully fitted with all mod cons and the living room is also an exquisite finish. The furnishings throughout the apartment are in line with its finish, oozing style and sophistication.\r\n \r\nBROADBAND AND REFUSE INCLUDED.\r\n\r\nOn street resident parking available. \r\nGas fired central heating. \r\nThe property is conveniently located in the heart of Waterford City Centre within walking distance to all local amenities including Waterford's bus and train station. \r\nStrictly no pets or smoking allowed. \r\n\r\n*These particulars do not constitute an offer or contract, and whilst every effort has been made in preparing all descriptions, dimensions, maps, and plans, these details should not be relied upon as fact. Dimensions / Illustrations are for guideline purposes only and not to scale. RE/MAX Property Specialists - Team Fogarty will not hold itself responsible for any inaccuracies contained therein"
      },
